00:15:42.983 --> 00:15:44.409
Yeah, it's mandatory.

399
00:15:44.409 --> 00:15:46.333
Boys do three years, girls do two years

400
00:15:46.333 --> 00:15:47.661
whether you like it or not.

401
00:15:47.661 --> 00:15:49.544
But you weren't under that mandatory?

402
00:15:49.544 --> 00:15:52.584
No, no, that's why it's called volunteer to the army.

403
00:15:52.584 --> 00:15:53.832
So I went back to...

404
00:15:53.832 --> 00:15:55.629
I could because my parents are Israeli

405
00:15:55.629 --> 00:15:59.504
and so I immigrated, I got my Israeli passport and you know.

406
00:15:59.504 --> 00:16:04.028
Right, so you go to Israel at 18, and it's the IDF.

407
00:16:04.028 --> 00:16:04.885
Correct.
Right.

408
00:16:04.885 --> 00:16:08.500
And typically women do like a two year tenure

409
00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:09.903
with this and men do three?

