438
00:17:04.062 --> 00:17:04.940
So they've got somebody perfect.

439
00:17:04.940 --> 00:17:06.594
Gung ho.
Yeah.

440
00:17:06.594 --> 00:17:09.136
So what is the training like?

441
00:17:09.136 --> 00:17:11.070
Like you don't go immediately

