It was a special unit space that trains commando,

458
00:17:50.118 --> 00:17:52.301
and special units from not only in Israel

459
00:17:52.301 --> 00:17:55.811
but outside of Israel as well in North America,

460
00:17:55.811 --> 00:17:59.504
Europe, Asia, and it's called Base 8.

